  "id": "copernicus-dem",
  "title": "Copernicus DEM GLO-30, release 2024_1",
  "description": "A Portolan mirror of the Copernicus DEM GLO-30, release 2024_1: the global 30 m digital surface model from the TanDEM-X mission, produced by DLR and Airbus Defence and Space and provided under Copernicus by the European Union and ESA. It holds all 26,475 one-degree tiles, each with its elevation model and four quality layers (height error, editing, filling and water body masks), as cloud-optimized GeoTIFFs with embedded statistics, re-encoded losslessly so pixel values match the source exactly. Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before you query.",
